{"id":"P046-1","subject":"P","unit":"P046","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P046-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n극수6, 도체수 250, 회전수 1200rpm인 파권 직류 발\n\n전기의 유기기전력이 600V가 되기위한 자속 몇 인\n\n가?\n\n\n① 0.01             ② 0.02\n\n③ 0.04             ④ 0.06\n\n⑤ 0.08","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1349}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n다음 설명에 해당하는 속도 제어법은?\n\n   이 속도 제어법은 전기자 전류에 거의 관계없이\n\n   비교적 광범위하게 속도 조정을 할 수 있으며,\n\n   정출력 가변 속도의 용도에 적합하다.\n\n\n\n① 저항제어       ② 직병렬제어\n\n③ 계자제어       ④ 워드레오나드제어\n\n⑤ 직병렬제어","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":639},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m02-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1874}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n권수비가 30인 단상 변압기에서 전부하의 2차 전압은\n\n6600V, 전압변동률은 1.5일 때, 1차 단자전압은 약\n몇 kV인가?\n\n\n① 168         ② 195\n\n③ 201         ④ 228\n\n⑤ 297","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":538},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m03-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n530V의 전압을 인가할 때 전류가 50A 인 직류 직권\n\n전동기의 회전속도가 1200rpm이다.\n\n이 전동기에 380V를 인가하고 전류는 동일한 조건일 때\n\n의 회전속도는 약 몇 rpm인가?\n\n(단, 전기자 저항과 계자 저항은 0.6Ω이다.)\n\n\n① 817         ② 879\n\n③ 895         ④ 918\n\n⑤ 997","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":639},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m04-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1253}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n교류 발전기의 회전속도가 450rpm, 극수가 16, 극당\n\n최대자속이 0.5, 전기자의 직렬도체수가 384개일 때,\n\n이 발전기의 유도 기전력은 약 몇 kV인가?\n(단, 이다.)\n\n\n① 19          ② 23\n\n③ 26          ④ 45\n\n④ 54","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":647},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m05-e1.webp","width":696,"height":629}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n정격전압 5000V, 용량 5MVA 인 3상 동기 발전기가\n\n여자전류 200A 에서 무부하 단자전압이 5000V, 단락\n\n전류가 600A일 때, 3상 동기 발전기의 단락비는 얼마\n\n인가?\n\n\n① 1.04         ② 1.17\n\n③ 1.25         ④ 1.89\n\n⑤ 2.24","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":550},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m06-e1.webp","width":678,"height":933}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n60Hz의 유도전동기에 50Hz의 교류를 인가할 때의\n\n설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 여자전류가 증가한다.\n\n② 동기속도가 16.6증가한다.\n\n③ 전동기 내부온도가 증가한다.\n\n④ 최대토크가 커진다.\n\n⑤ 기동전류가 커진다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m07-e1.webp","width":678,"height":949}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n유도전동기의 특징에 해당되지 않는 것은?\n\n\n① 별도의 교류전원이 아닌 상용전원을 직입하여 사용할\n\n  수 있다.\n\n② 구조가 간단하고 기계적으로 튼튼하다.\n\n③ 간단한 구조로 제작이 용이하다.\n\n④ 가격이 저렴하다.\n\n⑤ 부하에 따라서 속도를 크게 변화시킬수 있다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m08-e1.webp","width":696,"height":628}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n권수비가 20인 단상 변압기의 1차측 전압이 2000V,\n\n용량이 1600VA일 때, 2차측 전류는 몇 A 인가?\n\n(단, 부하의 역률은 지상으로 0.8이다.)\n\n\n① 12          ② 16\n\n③ 20          ④ 24\n\n⑤ 30","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":597},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m09-e1.webp","width":696,"height":838}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n1200rpm으로 회전하는 직류기의 주변속도는 몇 ms\n\n인가? (단, 전기자 반지름은 1.5m이다.)\n\n\n①          ② \n\n③          ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m10-e1.webp","width":696,"height":417}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n어떤 회로에 200V, 60Hz의 교류전압을 인가하니\n\n위상이 30° 뒤진 10A의 전류가 흘렀다. 이 회로의\n\n임피던스는 몇 Ω인가?\n\n①       ② \n③       ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":644},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024